## Title: Skill Point Finder
## Description: Shows every skill point your character is still missing, and the easiest way to get each one. When you enter a zone, a panel lists the skyshards, public dungeon group events and story points still waiting there. Inside a group dungeon it reminds you to pick up the dungeon quest. Open it from Settings > Add-Ons > Skill Point Finder: Overview, an easiest-first list, every zone ranked by points left, and a checklist of every group event and group dungeon quest. One button queues the Dungeon Finder for every dungeon whose quest this character hasn't done, on normal or veteran. Find it useful? Gold donations by in-game mail to @DextrousDigits (Xbox NA or EU) are very welcome.
